# Thanh Tùng — W3. Thay {{...}} bằng dữ liệu seed thực tế. Thanh toán hiện vẫn là MOCK (Tuần 2).
@host = http://localhost:5000
@khach = <JWT khách>
@nhanvien = <JWT nhân viên>

### Hồ sơ
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ho-so/toi
Authorization: Bearer {{khach}}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/ho-so/toi
Authorization: Bearer {{khach}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hoTen":"Khách Demo","email":"khach@example.com","soDienThoai":"0900000001","diaChi":"TP.HCM"}

### Đơn của tôi
GET {{host}}/api/v1/don-thue?trang=1&soMoiTrang=20
Authorization: Bearer {{khach}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/don-thue/1
Authorization: Bearer {{khach}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/don-thue/1/lich-su
Authorization: Bearer {{khach}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/don-thue/1/ban-giao
Authorization: Bearer {{khach}}

### Vận hành
GET {{host}}/api/v1/van-hanh/don-thue?canChuanBi=true
Authorization: Bearer {{nhanvien}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/van-hanh/don-thue/1
Authorization: Bearer {{nhanvien}}

### Thông báo
GET {{host}}/api/v1/thong-bao?chuaDoc=true
Authorization: Bearer {{khach}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/thong-bao/1/da-doc
Authorization: Bearer {{khach}}
